  model_assets -->|优化配置| model_objective
  model_objective -->|比较场景| model_scenarios
  model_scenarios -->|形成策略| operation_dispatch
  operation_dispatch -->|组织控制| operation_control
  operation_control -->|验证指标| validation_kpi
  validation_kpi -->|测试不确定性| validation_sensitivity
  validation_sensitivity -->|输出方案| validation_deliver
